45683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-18T18:30:56Z","updated_at":"2025-01-18T21:16:08Z","body":"> Regression from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99906.\n\nSome of these are not `Label` controls, so it's unlikely related to `Label` changes.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599821570/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"outdated"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599822045","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101708#issuecomment-2599822045","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101708","id":2599822045,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a9iLd","user":{"login":"Maran23","id":66004280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MDA0Mjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66004280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23","html_url":"https://github.com/Maran23","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-18T18:32:14Z","updated_at":"2025-01-18T18:32:14Z","body":"> Some of these are not `Label` controls, so it's unlikely related to `Label` changes.\n\nI justed checked that because I thought the same. Also edited the description just now. \nIt is actually a `EditorObjectSelector`, which uses a `Label` to display the text.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599822045/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599926200","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101708#issuecomment-2599926200","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101708","id":2599926200,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a97m4","user":{"login":"Maran23","id":66004280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MDA0Mjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66004280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23","html_url":"https://github.com/Maran23","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-18T20:59:45Z","updated_at":"2025-01-18T20:59:45Z","body":"I did a bit of debugging and indeed your fix just 'made it worse' (Calculation of Label is now correct IMO, the font/label height logic stuff is not, was not before).\nI don't know what the real problem is, but here are my observations:\n- min height calculation in `Label` is much bigger than the `Label` font size is. This is calculated with: `font_ascent` + `font_descent`. For a font size of 12px, it will be 17px. I would expect 12px.\n- A font size of 12px is rendered with a height of 9px. Again, I don't know if this is expected, but I would certainly not expect it.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d0d68354-0926-48d7-a097-09e34ea6a2c1)\nThis uses the `Editor Theme`, a normal `StyleBoxFlat` with everything set to default, and the `Nearest` filter.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599926200/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599958078","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101708#issuecomment-2599958078","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101708","id":2599958078,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a-DY-","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-18T21:06:11Z","updated_at":"2025-01-18T21:06:11Z","body":"Min. size accounts for all possible fallback fonts, so it's expected to be bigger (otherwise changing the text will change the height of the Label, which can be very distracting), but ascent / descent are actual measurements of the string. The off center positions issue is caused by difference between them applied only to descent, instead of distributing it to both ascent and descent.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599958078/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599971405","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101708#issuecomment-2599971405","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101708","id":2599971405,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a-GpN","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-18T21:15:12Z","updated_at":"2025-01-18T21:15:12Z","body":"> A font size of 12px is rendered with a height of 9px. Again, I don't know if this is expected, but I would certainly not expect it.\n> ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d0d68354-0926-48d7-a097-09e34ea6a2c1)\n\nIt seems to be correct, you are missing descender elements (parts under the base line in letters like `y`):\n<img width=\"1141\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d5e9a42e-a95b-4397-a4ed-5e6bd684aa77\" />\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599971405/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2600163395","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101708#issuecomment-2600163395","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101708","id":2600163395,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a-1hD","user":{"login":"Maran23","id":66004280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MDA0Mjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66004280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23","html_url":"https://github.com/Maran23","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-18T22:10:12Z","updated_at":"2025-01-18T22:10:12Z","body":"> Min. size accounts for all possible fallback fonts, so it's expected to be bigger\n\nI see. Thanks for the clarification. Normally, this would be no problem, since you just set the `vertical_alignment` to `Center`. But for the minimum size, this will not change anything.\n\n> It seems to be correct, you are missing descender elements (parts under the base line in letters like `y`)\n\nOh, good point, thanks for the clarification here as well.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2600163395/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]